Package: stm32-data-reader
Version: __VERSION__
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: HTL St. Pölten ECER <ecer@htlstp.ac.at>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1
Recommends: stm32flash
Homepage: https://github.com/htl-stp-ecer/stm32-data-reader
Description: STM32 Data Reader (raccoon_ring backend)
 Reads sensor data (IMU, analog, digital) from the STM32 microcontroller over
 SPI and exposes it via the raccoon_ring shared-memory transport / LCM, and
 forwards motor/servo commands the other way.
 .
 The package ships the matching STM32 firmware (wombat.bin) plus the flashing
 helpers and installs systemd units for the reader and the LCM loopback
 multicast setup. On a real Pi the firmware is flashed automatically on install.
